        ]
      },
      {
        "photo": "37129866",
        "name": "Nobody is watching",
        "score": "nobody",
        "lines": [
          "The self-consciousness that kept me indoors for a year turned out to be entirely constructed. Runners nod. That is the whole interaction."
        ]
      },
      {
        "photo": "31539139",
        "name": "Slow is the point",
        "score": "the point",
        "lines": [
